# World classify budget (ADR-061 throttle knobs): the GLOBAL ceiling on LLM classify calls across
# every world path. The kill-switch above stops spend entirely; these keep it ON but bounded —
# the 2026-06-29 burn (27 CLI spawns/min for 9h) is structurally impossible under them.
# WORLD_CLASSIFY_BUDGET_PER_HOUR=60
